bulleted)\n\n### Questions for Authors\n\n### Minor Issues\n\n### Scores\n- Soundness: X/5\n- Excitement: X/5  \n- Overall: X/5\n- Confidence: X/5\n```\n\nBe rigorous but fair. This is a negative-result paper—evaluate whether the negative results are convincingly established, not whether positive results were obtained."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_014iVPutYJse2xjGNVzCMbS7","session_id":"79301dc3-a43c-42c1-b7ac-01c347c8ab59","uuid":"4c133602-026e-4601-b054-0a5026c110b2","timestamp":"2026-05-15T10:24:11.304Z"}
