{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017VALvdaLE66MiD3zSPkxei","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# struct_self_consist_ie — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 10:17 UTC | 更新原因: D073: exp-019 verifier cancelled, Reviewer confirmed D072 direction\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n系统比较 5 类置信信号在 IE test-time scaling 中的有效性。**核心发现：universal correlation-selection gap（controlled ablation 证明 score compression 是 model/task intrinsic，非 constrained decoding artifact）。** 详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Review + 论文修订并行** — D072/D073 方向确定，Reviewer 四维度独立确认。\\\\n\\\\n### 关键进展\\\\n1. **exp-018 free-form ablation (NEGATIVE)**: LP std ratio 0.97, tied -2pp → constrained decoding 假设被证伪。Gap is universal.\\\\n2. **D072 framing**: Universal gap + controlled experiment evidence。Title 去掉 \\\\\\\"under Constrained Decoding\\\\\\\"。\\\\n3. **D073**: exp-019 verifier SKIPPED（Reviewer 建议：DDL 风险 + scope creep + analytical paper 不加 solution）。\\\\n4. **D070 写作修订**: 21 项完成验证 PASS。\\\\n5. **Parse rate 99.95%**: Bonus finding — fine-tuned 模型 free-form 下仍生成合法 JSON。\\\\n6. **Reviewer 审查**: 四维度确认 D072 方向，提供 7 处精确修改清单。\\\\n\\\\n### 评分趋势 + 突破策略\\\\nR1-R6: 3.0/5 plateau → 根因: content ceiling\\\\n**D072 突破**: controlled ablation (done) + universal framing + Reviewer 精确修改清单 = 从 observation 到 proven fundamental limitation\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] exp-018 free-form ablation (NEGATIVE → universality proven)\\\\n- [x] D072 + D073 decisions logged\\\\n- [x] paper_framing.md updated\\\\n- [x] D070 全部 21 项修订 PASS\\\\n- [x] Reviewer 独立评估完成（四维度确认）\\\\n- [ ] **Agent**: ablation 深度分析 + appendix table 准备\\\\n- [ ] **Agent**: 多种子实验 (seed 123/456) — 如果代码 ready\\\\n- [ ] **Paper Agent**: D072 patch（title + abstract + intro + discussion + conclusion 修改）\\\\n- [ ] **Paper Agent**: 补充 patch（parse